{"id":"CVE-2013-1635","state":"PUBLISHED","assigner":"mitre","published":"2013-03-06T11:00:00.000Z","updated":"2024-08-06T15:13:32.462Z","description":"ext/soap/soap.c in PHP before 5.3.22 and 5.4.x before 5.4.13 does not validate the relationship between the soap.wsdl_cache_dir directive and the open_basedir directive, which allows remote attackers to bypass intended access restrictions by triggering the creation of cached SOAP WSDL files in an arbitrary directory.","cwe":["n/a"],"metrics":[],"affected":[{"vendor":"n/a","product":"n/a","versions":["affected n/a"]}],"references":[{"url":"http://git.php.net/?p=php-src.git%3Ba=blob%3Bf=NEWS%3Bh=82afa3a040e639f3595121e45b850d5453906a00%3Bhb=refs/heads/PHP-5.3","tags":["x_refsource_CONFIRM"]},{"url":"https://bugs.gentoo.org/show_bug.cgi?id=459904","tags":["x_refsource_CONFIRM"]},{"url":"http://www.mandriva.com/security/advisories?name=MDVSA-2013:114","tags":["vendor-advisory","x_refsource_MANDRIVA"],"name":"MDVSA-2013:114"},{"url":"http://lists.apple.com/archives/security-announce/2013/Sep/msg00002.html","tags":["vendor-advisory","x_refsource_APPLE"],"name":"APPLE-SA-2013-09-12-1"},{"url":"http://bugs.debian.org/cgi-bin/bugreport.cgi?bug=702221","tags":["x_refsource_CONFIRM"]},{"url":"https://bugzilla.redhat.com/show_bug.cgi?id=918196","tags":["x_refsource_CONFIRM"]},{"url":"http://www.debian.org/security/2013/dsa-2639","tags":["vendor-advisory","x_refsource_DEBIAN"],"name":"DSA-2639"},{"url":"http://lists.opensuse.org/opensuse-security-announce/2013-08/msg00006.html","tags":["vendor-advisory","x_refsource_SUSE"],"name":"SUSE-SU-2013:1315"},{"url":"http://lists.opensuse.org/opensuse-security-announce/2013-07/msg00034.html","tags":["vendor-advisory","x_refsource_SUSE"],"name":"SUSE-SU-2013:1285"},{"url":"https://wiki.mageia.org/en/Support/Advisories/MGASA-2013-0101","tags":["x_refsource_CONFIRM"]},{"url":"http://support.apple.com/kb/HT5880","tags":["x_refsource_CONFIRM"]},{"url":"http://git.php.net/?p=php-src.git%3Ba=blo