{"id":"CVE-2013-1643","state":"PUBLISHED","assigner":"mitre","published":"2013-03-06T11:00:00.000Z","updated":"2024-08-06T15:13:32.313Z","description":"The SOAP parser in PHP before 5.3.23 and 5.4.x before 5.4.13 allows remote attackers to read arbitrary files via a SOAP WSDL file containing an XML external entity declaration in conjunction with an entity reference, related to an XML External Entity (XXE) issue in the soap_xmlParseFile and soap_xmlParseMemory functions.  NOTE: this vulnerability exists because of an incorrect fix for CVE-2013-1824.","cwe":["n/a"],"metrics":[],"affected":[{"vendor":"n/a","product":"n/a","versions":["affected n/a"]}],"references":[{"url":"http://www.ubuntu.com/usn/USN-1761-1","tags":["vendor-advisory","x_refsource_UBUNTU"],"name":"USN-1761-1"},{"url":"https://bugs.gentoo.org/show_bug.cgi?id=459904","tags":["x_refsource_CONFIRM"]},{"url":"http://git.php.net/?p=php-src.git%3Ba=commit%3Bh=8e76d0404b7f664ee6719fd98f0483f0ac4669d6","tags":["x_refsource_CONFIRM"]},{"url":"http://www.mandriva.com/security/advisories?name=MDVSA-2013:114","tags":["vendor-advisory","x_refsource_MANDRIVA"],"name":"MDVSA-2013:114"},{"url":"http://secunia.com/advisories/55078","tags":["third-party-advisory","x_refsource_SECUNIA"],"name":"55078"},{"url":"https://bugzilla.redhat.com/show_bug.cgi?id=918187","tags":["x_refsource_CONFIRM"]},{"url":"http://www.php.net/ChangeLog-5.php","tags":["x_refsource_CONFIRM"]},{"url":"http://lists.apple.com/archives/security-announce/2013/Sep/msg00002.html","tags":["vendor-advisory","x_refsource_APPLE"],"name":"APPLE-SA-2013-09-12-1"},{"url":"http://bugs.debian.org/cgi-bin/bugreport.cgi?bug=702221","tags":["x_refsource_CONFIRM"]},{"url":"http://rhn.redhat.com/errata/RHSA-2013-1307.html","tags":["vendor-advisory","x_refsource_REDHAT"],"name":"RHSA-2013:1307"},{"url":"http://rhn.redhat.com/errata/RHSA-2013-1615.html","tags":["vendor-advisory","x_refsource_REDHAT"],"name":"RHSA-2013:1615"},{"url":"http://www.debian.org/security/2013/