{"id":"CVE-2013-1803","state":"PUBLISHED","assigner":"redhat","published":"2014-05-05T17:00:00.000Z","updated":"2024-08-06T15:13:33.197Z","description":"Multiple SQL injection vulnerabilities in PHP-Fusion before 7.02.06 allow remote attackers to execute arbitrary SQL commands via the (1) orderby parameter to downloads.php; or remote authenticated users with certain permissions to execute arbitrary SQL commands via a (2) parameter name starting with \"delete_attach_\" in an edit action to forum/postedit.php; the (3) poll_opts[] parameter in a newthread action to forum/postnewthread.php; the (4) pm_email_notify, (5) pm_save_sent, (6) pm_inbox, (7) pm_sentbox, or (8) pm_savebox parameter to administration/settings_messages.php; the (9) thumb_compression, (10) photo_watermark_text_color1, (11) photo_watermark_text_color2, or (12) photo_watermark_text_color3 parameter to administration/settings_photo.php; the (13) enable parameter to administration/bbcodes.php; the (14) news_image, (15) news_image_t1, or (16) news_image_t2 parameter to administration/news.php; the (17) news_id parameter in an edit action to administration/news.php; or the (18) article_id parameter in an edit action to administration/articles.php.  NOTE: the user ID cookie issue in Authenticate.class.php is already covered by CVE-2013-7375.","cwe":["n/a"],"metrics":[],"affected":[{"vendor":"n/a","product":"n/a","versions":["affected n/a"]}],"references":[{"url":"http://www.waraxe.us/advisory-97.html","tags":["x_refsource_MISC"]},{"url":"http://osvdb.org/show/osvdb/90714","tags":["vdb-entry","x_refsource_OSVDB"],"name":"90714"},{"url":"http://www.openwall.com/lists/oss-security/2013/03/03/2","tags":["mailing-list","x_refsource_MLIST"],"name":"[oss-security] 20130302 Re: CVE request: PHP-Fusion waraxe-2013-SA#097"},{"url":"http://osvdb.org/90710","tags":["vdb-entry","x_refsource_OSVDB"],"name":"90710"},{"url":"http://www.openwall.com/lists/oss-security/2013/03/03/1","tags":["mailing-list","x_refsource_MLIS