{"id":"CVE-2013-7327","state":"PUBLISHED","assigner":"mitre","published":"2014-02-18T11:00:00.000Z","updated":"2024-08-06T18:01:20.393Z","description":"The gdImageCrop function in ext/gd/gd.c in PHP 5.5.x before 5.5.9 does not check return values, which allows remote attackers to cause a denial of service (application crash) or possibly have unspecified other impact via invalid imagecrop arguments that lead to use of a NULL pointer as a return value, a different vulnerability than CVE-2013-7226.","cwe":["n/a"],"metrics":[],"affected":[{"vendor":"n/a","product":"n/a","versions":["affected n/a"]}],"references":[{"url":"http://git.php.net/?p=php-src.git%3Ba=commit%3Bh=8f4a5373bb71590352fd934028d6dde5bc18530b","tags":["x_refsource_CONFIRM"]},{"url":"https://bugzilla.redhat.com/show_bug.cgi?id=1065108","tags":["x_refsource_CONFIRM"]},{"url":"http://www.ubuntu.com/usn/USN-2126-1","tags":["vendor-advisory","x_refsource_UBUNTU"],"name":"USN-2126-1"},{"url":"https://bugs.php.net/bug.php?id=66356","tags":["x_refsource_CONFIRM"]}],"vendors":["php"]}
{"id":"CVE-2013-7328","state":"PUBLISHED","assigner":"mitre","published":"2014-02-18T11:00:00.000Z","updated":"2024-08-06T18:01:20.321Z","description":"Multiple integer signedness errors in the gdImageCrop function in ext/gd/gd.c in PHP 5.5.x before 5.5.9 allow remote attackers to cause a denial of service (application crash) or obtain sensitive information via an imagecrop function call with a negative value for the (1) x or (2) y dimension, a different vulnerability than CVE-2013-7226.","cwe":["n/a"],"metrics":[],"affected":[{"vendor":"n/a","product":"n/a","versions":["affected n/a"]}],"references":[{"url":"http://git.php.net/?p=php-src.git%3Ba=commit%3Bh=8f4a5373bb71590352fd934028d6dde5bc18530b","tags":["x_refsource_CONFIRM"]},{"url":"https://bugzilla.redhat.com/show_bug.cgi?id=1065108","tags":["x_refsource_CONFIRM"]},{"url":"http://www.ubuntu.com/usn/USN-2126-1","tags":["vendor-advisory","x_refsource_UBUNTU"],"name":"USN-2126-1"},{"url":"https://bugs.php.net/bug.php?id=66356","tags":["x_refsource_CONFIRM"]}],"vendors":["php"]}
