{"id":"CVE-2013-7456","state":"PUBLISHED","assigner":"mitre","published":"2016-08-07T10:00:00.000Z","updated":"2024-08-06T18:09:17.049Z","description":"gd_interpolation.c in the GD Graphics Library (aka libgd) before 2.1.1, as used in PHP before 5.5.36, 5.6.x before 5.6.22, and 7.x before 7.0.7, allows remote attackers to cause a denial of service (out-of-bounds read) or possibly have unspecified other impact via a crafted image that is mishandled by the imagescale function.","cwe":["n/a"],"metrics":[],"affected":[{"vendor":"n/a","product":"n/a","versions":["affected n/a"]}],"references":[{"url":"http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/90859","tags":["vdb-entry","x_refsource_BID"],"name":"90859"},{"url":"http://www.openwall.com/lists/oss-security/2016/05/26/3","tags":["mailing-list","x_refsource_MLIST"],"name":"[oss-security] 20160526 Re: Fwd: CVE for PHP 5.5.36 issues"},{"url":"https://bugs.php.net/bug.php?id=72227","tags":["x_refsource_CONFIRM"]},{"url":"http://rhn.redhat.com/errata/RHSA-2016-2750.html","tags":["vendor-advisory","x_refsource_REDHAT"],"name":"RHSA-2016:2750"},{"url":"http://www.debian.org/security/2016/dsa-3602","tags":["vendor-advisory","x_refsource_DEBIAN"],"name":"DSA-3602"},{"url":"https://github.com/php/php-src/commit/7a1aac3343af85b4af4df5f8844946eaa27394ab?w=1","tags":["x_refsource_CONFIRM"]},{"url":"https://github.com/libgd/libgd/commit/4f65a3e4eedaffa1efcf9ee1eb08f0b504fbc31a","tags":["x_refsource_CONFIRM"]},{"url":"http://php.net/ChangeLog-5.php","tags":["x_refsource_CONFIRM"]},{"url":"http://php.net/ChangeLog-7.php","tags":["x_refsource_CONFIRM"]},{"url":"https://h20566.www2.hpe.com/portal/site/hpsc/public/kb/docDisplay?docId=emr_na-c05240731","tags":["x_refsource_CONFIRM"]},{"url":"http://www.debian.org/security/2016/dsa-3587","tags":["vendor-advisory","x_refsource_DEBIAN"],"name":"DSA-3587"},{"url":"http://www.ubuntu.com/usn/USN-3030-1","tags":["vendor-advisory","x_refsource_UBUNTU"],"name":"USN-3030-1"}],"vendors":["php"]}
